# inc-ckw0. Shared start for the grease and ice floor scenarios: a human
# paladin (chargen-paladin.keys, seed 4), wizard mode with Freeze Monsters on.
# A frozen hostile kobold stands in sight, so the character counts as
# threatened: an unthreatened creature TAKES 20 on a Balance check
# (Creature::SkillCheckTarget) and the die never matters. The including
# script chooses the terrain and the kobold's distance (the kobold is
# summoned by the including script, after this file).
@include chargen-paladin.keys
@until "Afoot" ESC
w
y
@choose "Wizard Mode Switches"
DOWN*10
SPACE
ESC
